      en: ["Located at an altitude of 1,300 meters, offering a cool mountain climate.", "Modeled after the traditional floating markets of Banjarmasin and Palembang.", "A major culinary destination for authentic Sundanese street food.", "The park covers several hectares of land around a central lake.", "Features a 'Rainbow Garden' with thousands of colorful tropical flowers.", "One of the most visited tourist attractions in the Bandung highland region.", "Visitors must use special 'coins' purchased at the entrance for transactions.", "Easily accessible from the city of Bandung via the Lembang mountain road."]
